function clearJournalForm(){['jEditId','jTitle','jText','jPrayer','jThanks','jMood','jSeed'].forEach(id=>{if(el(id))el(id).value=''}); if(el('jDate'))el('jDate').value=todayUS(); if(el('journalEditorTitle'))el('journalEditorTitle').textContent='Querido Dios...'; document.querySelectorAll('#journalMoodPicker button').forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active')); if(el('cancelJournalEdit'))el('cancelJournalEdit').hidden=true}
